Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.11,0:00:10.53,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,It has been one year since Sir Rio \Nand Latifa came to our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:16.03,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,I'm sure everyone is aware of how much \Nthe two of them have done for us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:18.97,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,So on this fine day of \Nthe Grand Spirit Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:22.04,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,with the kiss of blessing from Lady Dryas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:24.63,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,Sir Rio is hereby welcomed as our sworn friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:29.63,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,and Latifa as a resident of our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:45.85,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,I'm going to continue to \Ncount on the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:46.65,main,Rio; simultaneous,0,0,0,,Yes, milady!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:47.28,top,Latifa; simultaneous,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, milady!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:52.77,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,Now, that's the end of the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:55.03,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,Everyone! It's time to feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:57.03,main,everyone,0,0,0,,Yeah!
